<title>USA: Immune Response set for Phase III trial.</title>
<headline>Immune Response set for Phase III trial.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Immune Response Corp said on Monday it completed enrollment of its Phase III clinical trial of Remune therapy designed to fight the HIV virus.</p>
<p>The trial is designed to determine the effectiveness of Remune in slowing the progression of HIV, by stimulating the patient's own natural defense mechanisms against the virus.</p>
